CIVILIZATIONCLONE — CIV1-INSPIRED UI REFERENCE
ANSII ART SET: BOOT AND SETUP (CIV1-UI-001..006)

STYLE ROLES
<TITLE> major heading   <FOCUS> selected item   <INFO> supporting data
<ACTION> button         <MUTED> secondary text  <WARN> destructive/warning
Clients should map roles to their own ANSI color/theme implementation.

